md(r"""
**Decisions 1–3**
- **Dropped `customerID`:** it is only a label; keeping it would add noise and could cause the model to memorize individual customers.
- **Converted `TotalCharges` to numeric:** it was loaded as text because of the blank strings. Logistic regression needs numbers.
- **Filled the blank `TotalCharges` with 0:** all these customers have `tenure = 0`, so they haven't been billed yet and a total of 0 is the true value. This is better than dropping rows (we keep the data) or using the mean (which would claim they had paid hundreds of dollars).
